=== Possibly faulty data ===
* CardGuide lists Coruscant as the 30th product with 189 cards; the article gives 196 (98 Light / 95 Dark + 3). Removed from the lead: "CardGuide numbering: 30th product (CardGuide lists 189)."
=== Marginal cuts ===
